#: src\operations/overview.md:38
msgid ""
"[kanade-client](./agent-mediated-updates/client.md) — the Tauri end-user app"
msgstr ""
"[kanade-client](./agent-mediated-updates/client.md) — Tauri 製のエンドユー"
"ザーアプリ"

#: src\operations/overview.md:40
msgid ""
"[NATS server](./agent-mediated-updates/nats.md) — the broker itself (yes, "
"you can update the broker over the broker)"
msgstr ""
"[NATS サーバー](./agent-mediated-updates/nats.md) — ブローカー本体 (はい、ブ"
"ローカー越しにブローカーをアップデートできます)"

#: src\operations/overview.md:42
msgid ""
"[kanade-agent itself](./agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md) — the agent "
"self-update path (different from the other three; it uses a dedicated "
"rollout bucket, not the generic OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES + script pair)"
msgstr ""
"[kanade-agent 自身](./agent-mediated-updates/agent-self.md) — agent の self-"
"update 経路 (他 3 つと違い、汎用の OBJECT_APP_PACKAGES + script ペアではなく"
"専用の rollout バケットを使います)"

#: src\operations/deploy.md:3
